# Selects Riedquat on the short-range chart, launches, jumps there, and fights the pirates who come for
# an anarchy's visitors. The fight was played by a scratch steering program that read the targets'
# positions as it went; what it pressed is recorded here like any other replay. It destroyed one of them
# until the pirates measured their range without the DX the last handler left (ADR-046), and none after. It
# destroys one again since the chart's cursor moves by a click: the ship no longer launches with the roll the
# held arrow left in the keyboard's steering (ADR-065).
wait 3
key space; wait 4
key F5; wait 1
click 20 78; wait 0.799                  # Riedquat, 6.8 light years, clicked on the short-range chart (D111)
key F1; wait 7.901
